Y: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">5학기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;2) 교육대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">4학기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">2) 컨설팅대학원 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">4학기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 시험과목 </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 20.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp; 가. 석사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">3과목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 박사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"> 4과목</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 응시 과목 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">동일교수의 과목만으로 시행할 수 없으며,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;석/박사과정 모두 문제출제 교수가 반드시 2명 이상이어야 함<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(박사 응시생의 경우 A교수:2과목/B교수:2과목=&gt;가능<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;A교수:3과목/B교수:1과목=&gt;불가능)<br>&nbsp;</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">※ 졸업종합시험 응시과목은 학기차에 따라 한 과목씩 따로&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;응시할 수 없으며, 석사 3과목 이상/ 박사 4과목 이상<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;해당과목을&nbsp;일괄적으로 응시하여야 함</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">(단, 응시과목 중 불합격한 과목에 대해서는 한 과목 응시 가능함)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. 시험시간</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 석사과정 : 19:00 ~ 21:30 [150분]</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 박사과정 : 19:00 ~ 22:20 [200분]</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">5. 시험 과목 및 장소</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 추후 공지</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2012. 03.</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
